<title>SWEDEN: Perstorp says 6-mo profit falls 33 pct.</title>
<headline>Perstorp says 6-mo profit falls 33 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish chemical group Perstorp on Thursday posted results for the six month ended February 28, 1997.</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Pretax profit				208  vs   310</p>
<p> Turnover				   5,672  vs 6,368</p>
<p> Earnings per share (Skr)		 1.72 vs  2.81</p>
<p> Operating costs			   5,124 vs 5,688</p>
<p> Depreciation				  286 vs   307</p>
<p> Operating profit after deprec	   262 vs   373</p>
<p> Net financial items		CHARGE  54 vs    63 CHARGE</p>
<p> Tax						73 vs   102</p>
<p> Minorities				     12 vs     7</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
